  "description": "Yeo-Rin is a struggling writer who can’t seem to match the success of her previous work. Try as she might, she lacks the inspiration needed for her latest novel. That’s when In-Ha, the former soldier who inspired her best work, comes back into her life. He is still unabashedly blunt, she is still ridiculously stubborn, and they both still harbor feelings from that one night six years ago… In-Ha might be the key to unlocking Yeo-Rin’s next hit, but will it be a love story or just another tragedy?\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
